  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Smart, Solar, Energy Access Microgrids in Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to build an additional 22 community-scale solar photovoltaic micro-grids in southern Haiti where currently no grid power exists, providing affordable and reliable access to modern energy services. 

&#x2022; The project will build community resilience and demonstrate the use of microgrids as an adaptation measure. 
&#x2022; The project is innovative in that it incorporates a battery storage solution, offering 24-hour service and a viable economic alternative to current power sources that involve high levels of emissions and negative environmental impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
